      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002000740065006E0065006D006F00730020006D007500630068006F0020007400690065006D0070006F000A0070006100720061002000680061006300650072002000740061006E00740061007300200063006F007300610073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mis amistades me dieron una lista\nenorme de cosas para comprarles.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0069007300200061006D00690073007400610064006500730020006D006500200064006900650072006F006E00200075006E00610020006C0069007300740061000A0065006E006F0072006D006500200064006500200063006F0073006100730020007000610072006100200063006F006D0070007200610072006C00650073002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y si nos colamos en una\nde las fiestas de la SCL?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00590020007300690020006E006F007300200063006F006C0061006D006F007300200065006E00200075006E0061000A006400650020006C00610073002000660069006500730074006100730020006400650020006C0061002000530043004C003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Con el miedo que me da esa mujer,\nno quisiera hacerla enojar.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006E00200065006C0020006D006900650064006F00200071007500650020006D006500200064006100200065007300610020006D0075006A00650072002C000A006E006F002000710075006900730069006500720061002000680061006300650072006C006100200065006E006F006A00610072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Ya elegiste un plan de entrenamiento\npara el Pokémon más importante de tu equipo?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf, no. Todavía no me decido...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNo sé si ir por lo seguro y enseñarle movimientos\nequilibrados o si arriesgarme y convertirlo en una<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmáquina destructora contra un tipo concreto...",
